The following source trees are derived from Mihon/Tachiyomi and have been
adapted for use inside Folio's Kotlin Multiplatform shared module:

    shared/src/androidMain/kotlin/eu/kanade/...
    shared/src/androidMain/kotlin/mihon/...
    shared/src/androidMain/kotlin/tachiyomi/...
    shared/src/androidMain/kotlin/logcat/...

These files provide the manga extension runtime (extension loading, trust
verification, install flow) and the HTTP source engine (OkHttp interceptors,
Cloudflare/rate-limit handling, source and filter models). Modifications
were made to remove Mihon-specific dependencies, to fit Folio's manual
dependency-injection graph, and to bridge the vendored logcat and RxJava
APIs onto Folio's own logging and coroutine helpers.

The `logcat` package is derived from square/logcat
(https://github.com/square/logcat), Apache License, Version 2.0.

Injekt, consumed as a binary dependency (com.github.mihonapp:injekt), is a
fork maintained by the Mihon project of the original Injekt library by
Kamil Szymanski, Apache License, Version 2.0.

